This repository was migrated from the maintainer's existing LinkRead
code at revision a2297a5a7fe98d50435ce6bed1449ffca92e2aca. It is now
maintained as a separate desktop application with its own Python backend.
The migration does not claim that the CLI and desktop application have
unrelated code histories.

Migration changes include a private linkread_desktop Python package,
extraction of the desktop generation workflow from the former CLI module,
updated app build paths, and separate licensing and packaging metadata.
See docs/migration.md and docs/licensing.md.

Earlier revisions, including
c344033ef61e2a570529afc0b37c1bb3b2449933, carried Apache-2.0 terms.
Revision a2297a5a7fe98d50435ce6bed1449ffca92e2aca used component licensing
and a GPL output exception. Rights validly granted under earlier terms
remain in effect. The retained Apache-2.0 text is not a blanket alternative
license for new project material.

